thor'\u003eEmilia L.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class='jdgm-rev__location' \u003e  \u003c/span\u003e  \u003c/span\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-rev__content'\u003e  \u003cdiv class='jdgm-rev__custom-form'\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e \u003cb class='jdgm-rev__title'\u003e\u003c/b\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-rev__body'\u003e\u003cp\u003eI tried so many eyelash serums ... When I was done with my nerves, my head hurt 😬. There are so many of them. Who can you believe? Well, believe me!!! This stuff REALLY works (I don't work for this company nor was I paid for this review).\n\u003cbr /\u003e \n\u003cbr /\u003e Believe it or not, I actually get compliments from girls who have extensions for eyelashes. Come on... You have to agree with me... They look so fake. That's also the reason why I don't wear them. I even get compliments from men saying how beautiful my eyes are 🤭 At my doctor's office, his wife asked about my eyelashes.\n\u003cbr /\u003e \n\u003cbr /\u003e A long time ago I had single eyelashes glued. Ewww 😳 they stung and itched. After a few days they irritated me so much I started pulling them out.\n\u003cbr /\u003e \n\u003cbr /\u003e I apply it in the morning and just before bed. It has never irritated my eyelids.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-rev__pics'\u003e  \u003ca class='jdgm-rev__pic-link jdgm--loading' target='_blank' rel='nofollow' href='https://review-images.judgeme.com/luxe-cosmetics-uk/1736774718__0__LAElhF0B__V1ft8Y5_m6__original.jpg?quality=80\u0026amp;width=1024' data-mfp-src='https://review-images.judgeme.com/luxe-cosmetics-uk/1736774718__0__LAElhF0B__V1ft8Y5_m6__original.jpg?quality=80\u0026amp;width=1024' aria-label='Emilia L. review photo 1'\u003e \u003cimg class='jdgm-rev__pic-img' alt='Emilia L. review photo' data-src='https://review-images.judgeme.com/luxe-cosmetics-uk/1736774718__0__LAElhF0B__V1ft8Y5_m6__original.jpg?quality=80\u0026amp;width=160'\u003e \u003c/a\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-